       UNION        UNION ALL     EXCEPT        INTERSECT
          │              │           │              │
          ▼              ▼           ▼              ▼
    Both queries     Both queries  First query   Common rows
    + remove         + keep        MINUS         in both
    duplicates       duplicates   second
